1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.000
(singing) Oh all the comrades that e'er I've had

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.033
Are sorry for my going away

3
00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:20.833
And all the sweethearts that e'er I've had 

4
00:00:20.833 --> 00:00:28.599
would wish me one more day to stay.

5
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:34.300
But since it falls unto my lot

6
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:40.866
That I should rise and you should not

7
00:00:40.866 --> 00:00:48.532
I'll gently rise and I'll softly call

8
00:00:48.533 --> 00:00:56.466
Good night and joy be with you all 

9
00:00:56.466 --> 00:01:07.099
Good night and joy be with you all

